Kconfiglib 14.1.0 is vendored here as EdgeOS's Kconfig language engine and
ncurses menuconfig frontend.

Upstream: https://github.com/ulfalizer/Kconfiglib
Release:  14.1.0
License:  ISC (see LICENSE.txt)

The EdgeOS copy changes a documentation heading underline to avoid Git's
conflict-marker check and adds the centered Linux mconf/lxdialog frame, menu
border, instructions, legend, buttons, and menu placement. EdgeOS-specific
command handling lives in scripts/kconfig/conf.py. The UI uses only portable
ncurses drawing and does not contain terminal-emulator or platform-specific
color control.
